# Cloudflare Pages headers for learn.ongiini.ai
#
# The default cache-control on Pages is `public, max-age=14400`
# (4 hours) for static assets. That bit Sebastian on the carousel
# deploy: his browser served a 4-hour-old app.js so the new
# multi-step lesson renderer never ran. Drop the cache for HTML to
# zero (must-revalidate every load) and put a short window on the
# bundled JS/CSS — combined with the ?v=… query-string busters in
# index.html, this means deploys take effect immediately.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/app.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate

/app.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate

/i18n/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, must-revalidate
